110	     * Derives the owner's membership number, formatted {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'} where YY is the
111	     * last two digits of the registrationDate year (e.g. {@code 'NSW-1A2B3C4D-M26'}). Returns {@code null}
112	     * when either source field is absent, so owners without a customerCode or registrationDate map cleanly.
113	     */
